# Files where the fork's version must always win over upstream during merges.
# The `merge=ours` driver requires `git config merge.ours.driver true` to be
# set in the local clone (sync-upstream.sh and the CI workflow do this).
#
# Why these are pinned to the fork:
#  - .claude-plugin/marketplace.json: identifies this fork as the
#    `davidamom-seo` marketplace; upstream's name would collide and the
#    description line carries fork-specific copy.
.claude-plugin/marketplace.json merge=ours
